@startuml
' Figure 22.3  The memory record (class diagram)
' Reading order: the record in the middle, its source above, its scope
' rule below, its earlier version to the side. Fields from
' memory.record.MemoryRecord.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
class Source <<evidence>> {
  +event_id: str
  +kind: str
  +quote: str
}
class MemoryRecord <<knowledge>> {
  +tenant: from token
  +subject, value
  +scope, trip
  +confidence
  +observed_at, expires_at
  +version, supersedes
  +derived_from
  +status
}
class ScopeRule <<policy>> {
  +standing: confirmed only
  +trip: needs itinerary
}
MemoryRecord -up-> Source : cites
MemoryRecord .down.> ScopeRule : checked by
MemoryRecord -right-> MemoryRecord : supersedes
@enduml
